  tldr    = {This paper proposes k-sparse autoencoders (TopK SAEs) that directly control sparsity to improve the reconstruction-sparsity frontier, establishes clean scaling laws for SAE size and sparsity, and trains a 16 million latent SAE on GPT-4 activations.},
  tldr-zh = {本文提出使用 TopK 稀疏自编码器（SAE）直接控制稀疏度以改善重建-稀疏度边界，建立关于 SAE 规模与稀疏度的扩展律，并在 GPT-4 激活上训练了一个拥有 1600 万潜变量的 SAE。}
